    "document": "CT-Sinus-Without-Contrast.pdf",
    "source_type": "patient"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bilaterally the ethmoid air cells are unremarkable",
    "type": "Text",
    "page": 1,
    "document": "CT-Sinus-Without-Contrast.pdf",
    "source_type": "patient"
  },
  {
    "text": "The anterior recess region shows no pathology The frontal sinuses appear unremarkable and there is no disease in the hiatus semi-lunaris",
    "type": "Text",
    "page": 1,
    "document": "CT-Sinus-Without-Contrast.pdf",
    "source_type": "patient"
  },
  {
